  "Question": "What is the value of \\[ \\begin{aligned} &(3x - 2)(4x + 1) \\\\ &\\quad {}- (3x - 2)4x + 1 \\end{aligned} \\] when \\(x = 4?\\)",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(0\\)",
    "B": "\\(1\\)",
    "C": "\\(10\\)",
    "D": "\\(11\\)",
    "E": "\\(12\\)"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "D",
  "Solution": "When \\(x=4\\), we have \\(3x-2=10\\), \\(4x=16\\), and \\(4x+1=17\\). Substitute these values and perform the multiplications before the subtraction and addition:\n\\[\n10\\cdot17-10\\cdot16+1\n=170-160+1=11.\n\\]\nThe value is \\(\\boxed{11}\\), choice \\(\\mathrm{D}\\).",
